[{"title":"秋月","author":"王仲霞","text":"邻笛风飘断续鸣，一轮吹出九霄明。\n画堂烛灭光逾满，翠桁帘开气转清。\n细草侵阶含润意，残荷承露滴秋声。\n嫦娥莫悔偷灵药，夜夜窥人倍有情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20221,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新正初六外子书至掣签直隶尚候改近省","author":"王仲霞","text":"一封丹诏下兰台，十载眉痕渐放开。\n迎养愿伸乌鸟志，莱衣好共锦袍裁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20222,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"小立","author":"王仲霞","text":"翩翩翠袖捧丝桐，小立花阴趁晚风。\n只恐知音难问世，含情都在不弹中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20223,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初夏远眺","author":"王仲霞","text":"落花香处认芳丛，蛛网留春数点红。\n閒倚高楼忘昼永，山光云影夕阳中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20224,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"别舜江题壁","author":"王仲霞","text":"楼外层岚淡着烟，碧栏倚遍杏花天。\n行装重整来时箧，一棹轻舟忆去年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20225,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"展先夫子遗像二首 其一","author":"王仲霞","text":"糟糠回忆结同盟，黄卷当年共短檠。\n北阙恩膏曾沐泽，西泠风雨剧伤情。\n鸾箫难续生前韵，麟笔谁传没后名。\n拌死相随偏不易，扶持老幼费经营。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20226,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"展先夫子遗像二首 其二","author":"王仲霞","text":"蜀魄啼鹃意外声，兰陔缺养倍凄清。\n倡随虚说三生约，形影惟馀两泪倾。\n半世精神消道路，十年烽火误功名。\n关心最是难抛处，志愿何时了向平。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20227,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感怀","author":"王仲霞","text":"画荻丸熊事易商，恐难仲郢与欧阳。\n遗书重整留儿读，行箧新开付女装。\n难却愁思心化石，为筹家计鬓成霜。\n与君空说桃花院，纸阁芦帘瘗孟光。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20228,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春寒","author":"陆懿淑","text":"寒气朝犹逗，湘帘未捲时。\n重寻前夜梦，新写早春诗。\n梅发江南尽，鸿归塞北迟。\n曲阑閒倚处，日影度花枝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20229,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"绍兴舟中作","author":"陆懿淑","text":"篷窗徙倚夕阳时，到处桃开三两枝。\n信有春风轻似剪，长堤翠擘柳千丝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20230,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"月夜","author":"陆懿淑","text":"月照窗前夜转明，闺中静听已三更。\n瑶台应更凉如水，花影移阶辨未清。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20231,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"野望","author":"陆懿淑","text":"映树残阳淡欲无，炊烟起处水村孤。\n呕哑谁更摇兰橹，惊动溪鱼乱跳珠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20232,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纳凉","author":"陆懿淑","text":"月光如水浸楼台，风动盆荷暗里开。\n惹得流萤飞不定，夜深犹上绮窗来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20233,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"别后寄外","author":"陆懿淑","text":"话别迟迟执别难，征车偏促夕阳残。\n临歧不敢轻垂泪，忍到灯窗背后弹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20234,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采桑","author":"陆懿淑","text":"桑叶绿初成，提筐陌上行。\n东风初过去，一片剪刀声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20235,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"待燕","author":"陆懿淑","text":"画阁隐斜晖，雕梁燕未归。\n新雏方待乳，何忍下帘帏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20236,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"迎鸿","author":"陆懿淑","text":"八月当秋社，儿童报雁来。\n稿砧相别久，莫是有书回。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20237,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送外赴蜀","author":"陆懿淑","text":"忍攀杨柳繫征鞍，男子桑蓬逸处难。\n儿代课书休寄忆，亲能勿药便平安。\n连云蜀栈千寻上，捧日皇途一例看。\n领袖功名应不远，他年禄养好承欢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20238,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄妹婉卿即步原韵","author":"陆懿淑","text":"匆匆握别几多时，无限深情语转迟。\n烟水迢迢劳远梦，云山叠叠费相思。\n绿窗快赌当年绣，红烛閒敲永夜棋。\n此境已成陈迹逝，怜侬寂寞强题诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20239,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"因堂上病重偶成寄外","author":"陆懿淑","text":"于归屈指十年残，难把中怀一日宽。\n阅历渐随年齿长，别离敢谢仔肩难。\n原知世少忘忧草，安得人传夺命丹。\n却为病魔添百感，茫茫愁绪屡忘餐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20240,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"病中忆外","author":"陆懿淑","text":"平安例报寄征邮，病掩深闺独自愁。\n为检药方时强坐，频看宝镜懒梳头。\n玉钗敲折寒生袖，银烛挑残月上钩。\n寂寞夜深清不寐，听残连漏到鸡筹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20241,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送外赴金陵","author":"陆懿淑","text":"一窗灯火夜缠绵，手叠行装欲废眠。\n寒暖无常宜自重，文章有价在争先。\n明知此别无多日，正恐迟归已近年。\n却喜高堂犹健饭，放怀南下莫流连。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20242,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋雨","author":"陆懿淑","text":"水滴阶生响，风吹叶有声。\n梧桐深院里，终夜不胜情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20243,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"不寐","author":"陆懿淑","text":"闺中人静已深更，何处箫声杂管声。\n残月半窗清不寐，照人离恨太分明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20244,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"探梅","author":"陆懿淑","text":"一路经行处，烟深雪未消。\n不知春远近，相约过溪桥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20245,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏日閒居","author":"陆懿淑","text":"几声楼笛听依稀，团扇摇风暑气微。\n得意新蝉争树噪，忘机小蝶逐人飞。\n缸栽旧藕花增艳，檐覆修梧叶正肥。\n静对纱窗无个事，敲残棋局月临扉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20246,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄外","author":"陆懿淑","text":"千里关山隔，相思一见难。\n除非同入梦，权作醒时看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20247,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"再游西湖","author":"陆懿淑","text":"轻舟共赏好湖光，远见朱桥曲曲藏。\n忽听钟声刚报晚，碧山如画对斜阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20248,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏日閒居","author":"陆懿和","text":"临窗小榻自然凉，一枕清风觉梦长。\n睡起夕阳刚欲下，蒲葵扇底藕花香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20249,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山阴道中舟行远眺","author":"陆懿和","text":"东风又见柳垂丝，倚遍篷窗夕照时。\n一棹轻舟烟景好，桃花红褪隔墙枝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20250,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送春","author":"陆懿和","text":"暮春三月乱花飞，戏折花枝香满衣。\n不信东风留不住，杜鹃声里暗催归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20251,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"武林舟中送姊于归话别二首 其一","author":"陆懿和","text":"联袂成行未忍离，临歧祗是问归期。\n天涯遽作分飞雁，故嘱兰桡解缆迟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20252,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"武林舟中送姊于归话别二首 其二","author":"陆懿和","text":"行装打叠两旬忙，判袂舟中别绪长。\n偏是今宵天气好，片帆风顺送归航。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20253,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄姊","author":"陆懿和","text":"同眠姜被十馀年，忽隔云山路几千。\n昔日当窗偕赌绣，有时临案共披编。\n偶怜花落逢秋雨，閒数鸦飞傍晚烟。\n相约明春官舍里，与君重聚一堂前。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20254,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"除夕展先大人遗像","author":"陆懿和","text":"静听沉沉玉漏传，遗容相对暗凄然。\n伤心恐惹慈亲泪，强作欢颜绕膝前。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20255,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"残花","author":"陆懿和","text":"残花片片逐风飞，午梦初回懒换衣。\n欲认前番春色好，谁知红瘦绿阴肥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20256,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感怀寄姊","author":"陆懿和","text":"连宵风雨暗窗纱，万缕忧思乱似麻。\n黄叶满庭无婢扫，兰闺客到学烹茶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20257,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日偶成","author":"陆懿和","text":"桃花似锦色嫣然，燕语呢喃搅午眠。\n醒后不知天已暮，一帘花影月初弦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20258,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感怀","author":"陆懿和","text":"为贫处处强低头，渐觉眉稍欲上愁。\n转眼韶华浑似梦，一春无绪懒登楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20259,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"病中书怀","author":"陆懿和","text":"无聊终日枕频敧，强起摊书力甚疲。\n梦境迷离疑中酒，愁肠断续似枯棋。\n药方细检心常乱，绣被频添暖不知。\n我诵杜诗难愈疟，少陵谁道是良医。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20260,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送女于归张氏","author":"陆懿和","text":"少小依依绕膝前，悲欢形影共相怜。\n蓝桥听到催妆曲，绣阁惊开话别筵。\n鸿案相庄成令德，雀屏暗中是良缘。\n而今累我思前事，想到亲恩泪似泉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20261,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"先夫子湘辞世三载感而有作","author":"陆懿和","text":"忆别三年泪满襟，音容缥缈梦难寻。\n痴情欲化随君去，恐负遗言一片心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20262,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆姊","author":"陆懿和","text":"昨日清晨别，今宵百转思。\n无聊看明月，有意写新诗。\n帘际拈毫久，灯前听漏迟。\n音书虽可寄，不尽诉君知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20263,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菊影","author":"陆懿和","text":"一庭凉月浸，花影上窗来。\n风动犹疑画，霜侵未尽开。\n对君无片语，愧我少吟才。\n欲折何从觅，清香隔院回。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20264,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柴门","author":"陆懿和","text":"柴门尽被白云遮，绿水溪边听暮鸦。\n邻媪偶来茶当酒，且谈诗句且锄花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20265,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送晋载弟北上","author":"陆蕙芬","text":"束装送别思依依，此去堂堂近紫薇。\n汁染蕉衫拖碧柳，瑞呈蓉镜点朱衣。\n禹门高峻凭龙跃，云路翱翔羡鸟飞。\n待到姓名书淡墨，骅骝好奉锦标归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20266,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送三妹回吴门","author":"陆蕙芬","text":"相亲复相爱，同气本同情。\n别梦重山隔，归舟一叶轻。\n荒台芳草绿，广苑夕阳明。\n此日乘风去，何时扫径迎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20267,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闻砧二首 其一","author":"陆蕙芬","text":"砧杵谁家捣素秋，一声声度白萍洲。\n玉关萧瑟红闺冷，两地看来一样愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20268,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闻砧二首 其二","author":"陆蕙芬","text":"寒衣今又送凉州，独立桐阴听未休。\n午夜征袍缝密密，一针一泪刺心头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20269,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜感怀","author":"陆蕙芬","text":"瞥睹檐牙月一钩，银河耿耿未全收。\n蟾宫勤捣长生药，不管人间易白头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20270,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中秋月下作","author":"陆蕙芬","text":"半臂清辉中薄寒，幽花移影上栏杆。\n团圆共说今宵好，寂寞閒庭独自看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20271,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬夜独坐二首 其一","author":"陆蕙芬","text":"独坐清寥形影孤，夕香谁复共金炉。\n浮生悟澈真如梦，掌大冰花结盥盂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20272,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬夜独坐二首 其二","author":"陆蕙芬","text":"只影相亲似鹤单，心盟古井息波澜。\n玉钗敲断弹银烛，替我牵愁泪不乾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20273,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"诵经","author":"陆蕙芬","text":"盥手焚香散篆烟，解冤释劫诵诸天。\n尘缘久与飞灰尽，惟有冰心一片坚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20274,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"月夜偶成","author":"夏诒霖","text":"好云飞去不遮楼，细数秋花秉烛游。\n倦倚阑干凉夜永，碧天无际月如钩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20275,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题栈道图图为缪某入川作","author":"夏诒霖","text":"西风残照暮秋天，此去乡关不计年。\n云际归帆出巫峡，山头急涨下秦川。\n静投孤店连苍霭，漫卸征骖趁暝烟。\n寄语长途远游子，好凭壮志着先鞭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20276,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"早秋次许浑韵","author":"夏诒霖","text":"碧天澄似水，凉意满藤萝。\n新月悄依树，微云淡着河。\n吟怀中夜静，虫语入秋多。\n不觉年光晚，年年感逝波。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20277,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"古意二首 其一","author":"恽耐寒","text":"惜别多涕泪，那辨妾与郎。\n洒向合欢花，今年蒂作双。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20278,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"古意二首 其二","author":"恽耐寒","text":"记得槁砧归，握手殷勤语。\n金井晓鸦啼，却是催人去。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20279,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题兰竹石画卷","author":"恽耐寒","text":"石径青云矗碧霄，孤芳常伴影萧萧。\n若能待得春庭月，好约梅花过板桥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20280,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"马嵬","author":"恽耐寒","text":"血染红颜竟不还，荒坟何处土花斑。\n将军跋扈无人说，只把风流怨玉环。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20281,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春雨三首 其一","author":"缪徵甲","text":"江南有客罢寻芳，烟罩楼头水满塘。\n日日乍寒还乍暖，丝丝难织亦难量。\n早催风信三番过，为送云行一夜忙。\n此际濡毫应五色，借他春气入文章。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20282,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春雨三首 其二","author":"缪徵甲","text":"肯让晴光独占春，随时泽物化工神。\n宫莺喉转先回润，堤柳眉低亦效颦。\n有意为霖苏绿野，无边小草活红尘。\n寻常江海兼沟壑，一样分沾一样均。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20283,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春雨三首 其三","author":"缪徵甲","text":"要催春色遍天涯，不独分阴到碧纱。\n归燕暂教酣午梦，狂蜂未许乱朝衙。\n无声早洗千林雪，着地能开万国花。\n脉动西畴生意足，如膏先溉野人家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20284,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题张睢阳庙壁","author":"缪徵甲","text":"力障江淮第一功，孤城雀鼠亦全忠。\n桃花刀上蛾眉血，不比寻常薄命红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20285,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"盆兰","author":"缪徵甲","text":"先生斋头艺盆兰，花苞怒发如玉攒。\n有客入室青眼看，云此珍品殊等閒。\n孑然几案非饰观，位置宜向纱厨安。\n咏歌请为徵诗坛，不然移琴来就弹。\n先生闻语心骨酸，俗眼几人别木难。\n去年得此同茆菅，邻家弃置风叶乾。\n庑下我怜梁伯鸾，三熏三沐土自抟。\n一饭庶比淮阴韩，蔽以袅袅青竹竿。\n挹以清露宵漙溥，参差茎叶根屈蟠。\n孤鸿息影修羽翰，累累蕊珠初发端。\n对之忽若忘忧谖，其时八月秋未阑。\n素花七朵香可团，离离瘦影垂阑杆。\n似劝知己先加餐，小雪已过大雪寒。\n帷车闭置重缮完，松钗拥护根不单。\n菽乳灌沃冀使蕃，周防黠鼠智力殚。\n中夜拂拭忧摧残，一朝娇鸟辞笼樊。\n青芝赤箭郁以繁，幽香远胜罗旃檀。\n访者履满言者谰，安知当日弃溷藩。\n先生长吟客泪潸，兰亦无言暗自叹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20286,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄内二首 其一","author":"缪徵甲","text":"局蹐鹪鹩寄一枝，贫家门户赖卿持。\n老亲奉薄餐须早，稚子衣寒睡莫迟。\n雨夜断薪愁爨火，霜晨汲水裂凝脂。\n更馀逋负当残腊，荩箧搜罗强自支。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20287,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄内二首 其二","author":"缪徵甲","text":"终窭无闻交谪声，寒宵倡和忆深更。\n才能蕴藉方为福，诗到奇穷转更清。\n年过老泉频诫我，世无德曜定推卿。\n祇怜林下长饥鹤，不及朝阳采凤鸣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20288,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画马","author":"缪徵甲","text":"伏枥何须试一鸣，昂昂千里见平生。\n王良伯乐世安有，不受鞭笞自在行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20289,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭薇初叔","author":"缪徵甲","text":"列宿郎官秩正加，每从尘土梦京华。\n三膺帝简衡文尺，两见门生及第花。\n蓦地春风悲画省，空馀香雪糁天涯。\n江湖潦倒惭苻朗，轶足谁怜壮志赊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20290,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泥菩萨","author":"缪徵甲","text":"泥菩萨，何时灵。\n易欺者，昏夜之黑黑，难欺者，上天之青青。\n上天命尔镇一方，襆头象简何轩昂。\n尔须扶善锄豪强，莫贪豪强陈酒浆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20291,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"麻姑","author":"缪徵甲","text":"仙乎仙乎何飘飘，白云在天不可招。\n海南珠，山东茧，送人仙家听仙选。\n天医星，能活人，仙人一笑化作尘。\n城头狐，恃虎符，仙人一怒伏厥辜。\n仙乎仙乎真仙姑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20292,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]